Package: ScRNAseqBSVA
Title: Single-cell clustering and labeling
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Brando Stanislao", "Vaccarino Aureli", , "brandostanislao.vaccarino@mail.polimi.it",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Package for single-cell lable asignment and evaluation using clustering approaches.
    The package also handles data loading and preprocessing. This package is mainly built
    around the Seurat package. It simplyfies and streamlines the most comonnly used Suerat
    functions and steps used for single-cell data analysis.
